{"id":"4701","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4701_main_sun-pillar_photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张照片拍摄于泽西岛泽西机场，图中显示的是在日出点的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">日柱</span>。日柱说明存在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷层云</span>，而日柱是由阳光经板状冰晶反射而形成的。卷层云非常薄而且没有特征，没有明显的细节，因此属于雾状云种。天空中还有一些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷云</span>的碎片。报告显示，在英格兰南部、英国和法国北部可以看到日柱。在跑道上可以看到一小片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浅雾</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西岛泽西机场","latitude":"纬度: 49° 12' 23'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 11' 44'' W","date":"27 April 2010 0558 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.3.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.3.1"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4701_syn_sun-pillar_photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1030 hPa的高压集中在法国东北部，而大西洋东部上空的锋较弱。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 德国气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4701_upper_sun-pillar_photometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>英国英格兰坎伯恩最近的逆风站（WMO 03808）的上升气流显示了在约10800米处有一层浅湿层，是可能出现薄卷层云的高度。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5460_main_sun-pillar_photometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">日柱</span>是一个明亮的光柱，在太阳上方垂直延伸。它是由于板状冰晶反射光而形成。本实例为日落后不久的日柱。  </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Rocky Togni","location":"美国，阿肯色州，希伯斯普林斯","latitude":"纬度: 35° 26' 49'' N","longitude":"经度: 92° 3' 58'' W","date":"07 January 2009 1722 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.3.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.3.1"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5534_main_terrestrial-light-pillars_photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在极寒天气的夜间，有时可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">从陆地光源向上延伸的光柱</span>。在这种天气下，气温为–28 °C，空气中冰晶的光反射形成了光柱。此图是面向加拿大努纳武特地区剑桥湾机场（CYCB）拍摄。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Eric Van Lochem","location":"加拿大，努纳武特地区，剑桥湾","latitude":"纬度: 69° 7' 1'' N","longitude":"经度: 105° 3' 35'' W","date":"09 April 2015 2130 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.3.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.3.3"}]}]}